build: 2026-06-21 v10.34.19 (Pulse reading: no more phantom heart rate)
branch: claude/piano-roll-clip-view-wozlie
includes: Fixes a bug surfaced by a device log: when the finger left the camera lens, the heart rate stayed frozen at its last value (e.g. 66) for a minute or more even though the signal was gone. Now the held rate clears as soon as the lock is truly lost, so a number on screen always means a live reading. Note for best results with the camera pulse: cover BOTH the rear lens and the flash with your fingertip, press gently (not hard), and hold still — in testing the lock reaches high confidence within a few seconds when placed well; dark/flickering frames mean the finger isn't sealing the light. Verified: Xcode Compile Check + CI green.
